              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu eeharuuseedá' mibaá nee tsár ganara tláy, gari báy, «Ga/aawaagáy, hamí a tsa/a/amaán tawa Yerusalémúr kawaan, nee tidá' sleémeero taa gooín nee aaruuse daanduú Garmoó Heewo i bó/. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma ku qaas gawaá dabaá xoordaá hatlá'. Inooín kway niqín, kway /oosliislín, kway i nitsimiit, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kway muux ar qaw'i, kway gaas. Bál tame niri waaslee/.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.33"
            ]
          }
        }
